[00:11.52]1. Men make gods of wood and stone,
[00:15.20]But the true God they’ve not known.
[00:19.10]He is God Almighty,
[00:23.60]As he’s often shown.
[00:28.10]Other gods just cannot see
[00:32.60]What in future days will be.
[00:37.10]For witnesses they look all in vain,
[00:40.42]Since none their godship can maintain.
[00:43.74](Chorus)
[00:47.06]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[00:50.38]We speak out in fearlessness.
[00:55.38]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[01:00.38]What he foretells comes to be.
[01:12.19]2. Proudly we declare God’s name,
[01:16.69]Bearing witness to his fame.
[01:21.19]News about his Kingdom,
[01:25.69]Boldly we proclaim.
[01:30.19]We help others come to see
[01:34.69]How the truth can set them free.
[01:39.55]As they grow strong, their voices they’ll raise,
[01:44.05]Singing to God this song of praise.
[01:47.05](Chorus)
[01:50.05]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[01:53.05]We speak out in fearlessness.
[01:58.05]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[02:02.55]What he foretells comes to be.
[02:07.18]3. Witnessing exalts God’s name,
[02:11.82]Lifts therefrom reproach and shame.
[02:16.46]And it warns the wicked,
[02:21.38]Who God’s name defame.
[02:25.25]Pardon it holds out to men,
[02:29.12]If they turn to God again.
[02:34.52]Whole-souled devotion brings joy and peace;
[02:39.42]Promise of life that will not cease.
[02:42.84](Chorus)
[02:46.27]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[02:49.69]We speak out in fearlessness.
[02:53.29]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[02:58.09]What he foretells comes to be.